/*
 * The palace avenue — east of outside13, turns north.
 *
 * Strategy A FluffOS room. Original (TimeMsg, north
 * outside15) is outside14_ldmud.lpc. Look at Lady
 * flowers / cinnamon / lime trees is flavour. Archive
 * keeps “thier”.
 */

